# Test file for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
# Click "Send Request" above each block. The login saves a cookie that the
# later requests in this file reuse automatically.

@base = http://localhost:5000/api
@ownerEmail = ontiretse@biust.ac.bw
@ownerPassword = OwnerPass123!

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### 1. Admin portal login (Owner)
POST {{base}}/auth/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{ownerEmail}}", "password": "{{ownerPassword}}" }

### 2. Dashboard stats (needs the login above)
GET {{base}}/stats/dashboard

### 3. List guesthouses (public - consumer app)
GET {{base}}/guesthouses?city=gaborone&sort=rating

### 4. Search guesthouses (public)
GET {{base}}/guesthouses?search=kalahari

### 5. Create a guesthouse (multipart; logo/gallery files optional)
POST {{base}}/guesthouses
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----MiCasaBoundary

------MiCasaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Sunset Suites
------MiCasaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pricePerNight"

590
------MiCasaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="city"

Gaborone
------MiCasaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="country"

Botswana
------MiCasaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Modern suites with rooftop views.
------MiCasaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="amenities"

Wifi, Parking, Breakfast
------MiCasaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="contact"

+267 76 555 777
------MiCasaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="latitude"

-24.653
------MiCasaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="longitude"

25.912
------MiCasaBoundary--

### 6. Create an Admin (Owner only)
POST {{base}}/admins
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Don K.", "email": "don@biust.ac.bw", "password": "DonPass123!" }

### 7. Consumer signup
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test Traveller", "email": "traveller@test.com", "password": "Traveller123!" }

### 8. Rate a guesthouse (paste an id from request 3)
POST {{base}}/guesthouses/1/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stars": 5 }

### 9. Add to favourites
POST {{base}}/guesthouses/1/favorite

### 10. My favourites
GET {{base}}/favorites

### 11. Forgot password (check the terminal for the link)
POST {{base}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "traveller@test.com" }
